The module must provide complete financial management capabilities for residential society operations, including maintenance billing, income collection, expenses, services and vendors, staff salaries, society funds, payment receipts, approvals, financial audit trails, and financial reports.

The final implementation must use the existing application's database, authentication system, role assignments, UI components, and design system.

